<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy November 2026</title>
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: white;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7000ff, #ff176b, #ff9a00);
}
.card {
  margin: 20px;
  padding: 30px 20px;
  max-width: 450px;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  border-radius: 25px;
}
h1 { font-size: 42px; }
p { font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; }
button {
  padding: 14px 22px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: #a00062;
  background: white;
}
#message { display: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <div style="font-size:55px">🎉❤️✨</div>
  <h1>Happy November 2026!</h1>
  <h2>Welcome to a New Month</h2>
  <p>May this November bring you happiness,
  good health, peace, success, and unexpected
  blessings. May your hard work bring good
  results and your dreams move closer.</p>
  <button onclick="document.getElementById('message').style.display='block'">
    Open Your Blessing ❤️
  </button>
  <p id="message">
    This month, may good news locate you,
    doors of opportunity open for you,
    and joy fill your heart. Keep believing,
    keep growing, and never give up! 🙏🏽
  </p>
  <h3>From Peace ✌️ Maker</h3>
  <p>Stay Happy • Stay Blessed • Keep Grinding</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
